    <briefdescription>
<para>Parses and evaluates infix arithmetic expressions built from +, -, *, /, parentheses, and (possibly decimal) numbers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class used to live inline inside the calculatorapp sample application; it was moved into the library so it can be unit tested with googletest independently of the interactive app. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
